{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":96,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"856cb09f-9156-48b8-a772-b1235e530d01","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151022502,"PostDateInt":1747121294000,"PostDate":"2025-05-13T15:28:14","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"储能测试工程师","OrgId":1704663,"Org":"系统测试部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市·宝安区"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、负责工商业储能系统（BESS）的测试方案设计、测试用例编写及测试执行，包括硬件、软件及系统级测试；\n2、针对储能系统核心部件（电池模组、BMS、PCS、EMS等）进行功能测试、性能测试、可靠性测试及安全性验证；\n3、分析测试数据，定位系统问题并推动研发团队优化设计，输出测试报告及问题追踪记录；\n4、参与制定测试标准和流程，完善测试体系，编写测试相关技术文档；\n5、搭建测试环境，开发自动化测试工具或脚本，提升测试效率；\n6、配合项目团队完成产品认证测试（如UL、IEC、GB等标准），确保产品符合国内外法规要求。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，电气工程、自动化、电子工程、新能源等相关专业；\n2、3年以上储能系统、锂电池系统测试经验，熟悉工商业储能系统架构及技术原理，熟悉PCS/BMS通信协议（如CAN、Modbus）；\n3、熟悉储能系统测试方法，如电池性能测试、能量管理测试、热管理测试、可靠性测试等；\n4、熟悉储能系统相关标准（如UL 9540、IEC 62619、IEC62477、GB/T 36276等），有海外认证经验者优先。","ClassificationOne":"技术类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-05-13T15:28:14","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":fals